  "prefLabel": "Puc 504.01 Heating Value Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 504.01 Heating Value Requirements.\n\n(a) The standard heating value for the gas a utility furnishes the public established pursuant to En 504.01(a) shall be stated in its tariff.\n\n(b) Each utility shall provide a definition in its tariff of the methodology used to determine the thermal heating value.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 500) #13794, eff 10-25-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc500.html"
